  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "Shuck Week Contest #2 🎉 Win FREE oysters for a year from Jones Oyster Company, plus prize packs from our friends at Red Clay and Honest Scoop Ice Cream! \n\nWe’re giving one lucky winner the chance to indulge in the freshest, most delicious raw oysters for an entire year! 🥳\n\n🎟️ To enter:\n1) Follow The Jones Oyster Co., Red Clay, and Honest Scoop Ice Cream \n2) Like this post.\n3) Tag a friend in the comments who loves oysters as much as you do!\nFor bonus entries, tag us on social during your Shuck Week visit, or tag additional friends in the comments!\n\n🎁 Prize includes:\n- 🦪 One dozen Chef’s Choice oysters each month for 12 months from Jones Oyster Company\n- 🌶️ A Red Clay prize pack featuring a hot sauce gift set, honey gift set, Southern Chili Crisp, and Pitmaster Chili Crisp\n- 🍨 Two pints of ice cream from Honest Scoop\n\nGiveaway ends: August 8th, 2026, at 11:59 PM.\n• Winners will only be contacted by The Jones Oyster Co..\n• Oyster vouchers are redeemable at Jones Oyster Company (22 E. Court St., Greenville, SC).\n• All prizes are for local pickup only.\n• Prize is non-transferable and cannot be redeemed for cash.\n\nGood luck! 🍀"
